WEBVTT

01:40.200 --> 01:43.009
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.120 --> 01:46.060
[Episode 20]

01:48.160 --> 01:49.440
Jiu?

02:01.130 --> 02:01.920
Jiu?

02:16.050 --> 02:17.100
Sister Pei!

02:18.230 --> 02:19.260
Sister Pei.

02:22.270 --> 02:23.190
Sister Pei.

02:25.460 --> 02:26.440
Don't kill her.

02:26.760 --> 02:28.820
You really care about her, don't you?

02:28.860 --> 02:30.100
I just don't think

02:31.780 --> 02:33.460
you should alert them.

02:38.090 --> 02:38.880
After all,

02:40.940 --> 02:43.000
our target is Zhao Yuanzhou.

02:43.590 --> 02:44.850
I'll wait for it to dry.

02:49.170 --> 02:50.410
Just a small patch is wet.

02:50.410 --> 02:51.610
Why bother?

02:55.530 --> 02:56.550
Bai Jiu,

02:57.550 --> 02:59.530
we need to check your wrist.

03:30.660 --> 03:32.610
I am indeed from Chongwu Camp.

03:40.350 --> 03:42.530
You're very curious, aren't you?

03:44.030 --> 03:45.800
Yes, I am.

03:47.280 --> 03:50.230
When did he start to seal my five senses?

03:54.470 --> 03:55.690
You each take one.

03:55.880 --> 03:58.600
I made these detoxification pills myself.

03:58.860 --> 03:59.840
Taste.

04:06.330 --> 04:07.630
What do you want from me?

04:07.630 --> 04:09.450
This is the new version of Huanling Powder I developed.

04:09.450 --> 04:10.520
Are you ready?

04:13.440 --> 04:14.360
Smell.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.610
I feel nothing.

04:17.890 --> 04:19.800
I even want to laugh.

04:23.840 --> 04:25.220
I'm so scared.

04:25.590 --> 04:27.010
Sight.

04:27.090 --> 04:29.130
Then why are you covering my eyes?

04:29.190 --> 04:30.790
Cover your own eyes.

04:31.740 --> 04:33.180
I can't see the road.

04:33.210 --> 04:34.150
It's so scary.

04:34.170 --> 04:35.270
What's that sound?

04:35.290 --> 04:36.590
Put this on.

04:36.800 --> 04:39.190
I think something is definitely wrong with this voice.

04:39.190 --> 04:40.130
Don't listen.

04:40.470 --> 04:41.450
Hearing.

04:47.890 --> 04:51.130
I never expected that seemingly harmless Little Bunny

04:51.830 --> 04:54.090
could be so meticulous.

04:54.750 --> 04:56.350
To accomplish great things,

04:56.390 --> 04:58.520
one must not only have deep foresight

04:59.710 --> 05:01.420
but also patience

05:02.570 --> 05:04.490
to set up the game step by step.

05:05.220 --> 05:06.530
Zhao Yuanzhou,

05:07.360 --> 05:10.440
from the moment you entered Tiandu City,

05:11.390 --> 05:12.710
you have been stepping into this chessboard,

05:12.710 --> 05:14.670
bit by bit.

05:15.390 --> 05:18.280
Where do you think the list of these five people

05:18.350 --> 05:20.080
in the vanguard squad formed by

05:21.190 --> 05:23.280
the Demon Hunting Bureau came from?

05:24.120 --> 05:26.160
Didn't Mr. Zhuo make it?

05:29.860 --> 05:31.470
So it was you.

05:33.860 --> 05:35.840
To obtain your inner core,

05:36.430 --> 05:38.360
we must seal your five senses.

05:39.580 --> 05:42.300
Bai Jiu could do that for me.

05:42.909 --> 05:44.950
However, he lacks experience

05:45.409 --> 05:47.980
and needs someone to protect him.

05:49.220 --> 05:50.360
Ms. Pei,

05:51.650 --> 05:53.390
you don't think our Chongwu Camp

05:53.390 --> 05:54.790
is a place you can enter

05:54.790 --> 05:56.600
or exit at will, do you?

05:57.030 --> 06:00.090
You deliberately arranged for me to leave Chongwu Camp

06:00.160 --> 06:02.630
and then be noticed by the Demon Hunting Bureau.

06:02.630 --> 06:05.030
Ms. Pei, not only are you a good archer,

06:05.430 --> 06:08.360
but you are also the bodyguard of the Prime Minister.

06:08.560 --> 06:11.360
Moreover, you have a grudge against Chongwu Camp.

06:11.710 --> 06:12.790
Who else would

06:12.790 --> 06:14.650
the Demon Hunting Bureau choose

06:15.580 --> 06:17.840
besides an outstanding talent like you?

06:19.470 --> 06:22.870
Besides, you just suffered the loss of your younger brother.

06:23.430 --> 06:24.590
When facing Bai Jiu,

06:25.390 --> 06:27.720
would there be any emotional projection?

06:27.770 --> 06:29.850
Over time, when you grow deep feelings for him,

06:29.850 --> 06:32.380
you will surely risk your life to protect him.

06:33.460 --> 06:36.590
Bai Jiu calls you 'Sister Pei' every day;

06:38.630 --> 06:40.490
you must be enjoying that, right?

06:40.870 --> 06:42.550
Despicable.

06:43.310 --> 06:45.400
If Bai Jiu couldn't succeed,

06:46.270 --> 06:48.070
I would still have a backup plan.

06:50.550 --> 06:52.400
Even Mr. Zhuo

06:53.830 --> 06:56.240
is one of your pawns.

06:57.730 --> 07:00.350
Zhuo Yichen is the leader of the Demon Hunting Bureau.

07:00.350 --> 07:03.280
It was reasonable for him to join the vanguard squad.

07:03.750 --> 07:06.080
Besides, he has the Cloud Light Sword.

07:06.110 --> 07:08.510
He's the only one who can kill you.

07:09.630 --> 07:11.440
As for Baize Goddess...

07:12.070 --> 07:13.560
I'll cooperate with Li Lun

07:13.560 --> 07:15.550
to help him destroy the Baize Token.

07:15.550 --> 07:17.270
I promise I'll give you

07:17.970 --> 07:19.570
Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core.

07:22.130 --> 07:24.300
What about your promise to me?

07:25.380 --> 07:26.070
To merge

07:26.070 --> 07:28.550
the Baize Token hidden in you and Wen Xiao,

07:28.830 --> 07:31.110
we naturally need to bind you together

07:31.380 --> 07:32.710
to endure hardships

07:33.150 --> 07:35.280
so that you can understand each other.

07:37.060 --> 07:39.100
Now, there's only one last step left

07:39.100 --> 07:40.510
to seal your five senses.

07:42.310 --> 07:44.110
I just need to use a silver needle

07:44.870 --> 07:46.550
to seal your touch,

07:48.110 --> 07:50.240
and everything will be accomplished.

07:54.830 --> 07:56.290
What does a mortal like you

07:57.230 --> 07:59.430
want with my inner core?

07:59.590 --> 08:01.700
Who wants your foul inner core?

08:03.250 --> 08:04.150
From the beginning,

08:04.150 --> 08:06.610
what I want is always the Ever-Burning Wood.

08:08.990 --> 08:10.500
It's been such a hard journey.

08:10.500 --> 08:11.910
I finally found

08:11.910 --> 08:13.070
the Ever-Burning Wood that he wants.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.190
It is said that

08:14.760 --> 08:16.930
this is the last piece of Ever-Burning Wood in the world.

08:16.930 --> 08:18.660
We must keep a close watch on it.

08:21.370 --> 08:22.530
Eight years ago,

08:23.180 --> 08:25.380
you inhaled

08:25.730 --> 08:28.430
the last piece of Ever-Burning Wood that I had found

08:28.430 --> 08:29.760
with great difficulty.

08:32.220 --> 08:34.620
I have been looking for you for eight years.

08:52.090 --> 08:53.350
Go ahead, my disciple.

09:17.150 --> 09:18.020
Bai Jiu,

09:19.540 --> 09:21.510
aren't we your friends?

09:34.960 --> 09:36.220
Don't come any closer.

09:37.430 --> 09:38.790
I don't want to hurt you.

09:41.630 --> 09:43.430
You've already said so much;

09:44.560 --> 09:46.190
how could I possibly

09:46.190 --> 09:48.520
just let Little Bunny stick a needle in me?

10:11.380 --> 10:13.040
What's wrong, Zhao Yuanzhou?

10:14.460 --> 10:17.810
It seems like you can't cast your spells.

10:34.360 --> 10:35.410
Jiu,

10:36.230 --> 10:37.440
think it through.

11:17.780 --> 11:18.580
Stop.

12:02.000 --> 12:11.190
[Book of Rites]

12:15.110 --> 12:17.170
As expected, at the critical moment,

12:18.450 --> 12:20.180
you still wished for him to live

12:21.730 --> 12:23.190
and didn't want him to die.

12:28.590 --> 12:29.350
Don't worry.

12:29.830 --> 12:31.430
Whether it's Mr. Fan's order

12:32.150 --> 12:33.650
or the Prime Minister's,

12:34.350 --> 12:35.610
it cannot suppress me.

12:38.480 --> 12:40.610
The only one who can kill Zhao Yuanzhou

12:40.710 --> 12:42.060
is me.

12:44.230 --> 12:46.540
I won't be anyone's executioner.

12:47.710 --> 12:49.030
Well, if we

12:49.610 --> 12:51.280
restore the Baize Token

12:52.310 --> 12:56.310
and are ultimately able to suppress Zhao Yuanzhou's malicious energy,

12:56.340 --> 12:57.670
will you still kill him?

13:02.190 --> 13:03.720
The Yao Water was polluted,

13:05.000 --> 13:06.860
and the Divine Wood went missing.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.160
The "if" you mentioned

13:09.450 --> 13:11.110
seems too distant to hope for.

13:11.910 --> 13:14.440
I won't answer such a hopeless hypothetical.

13:15.010 --> 13:16.120
But what if

13:16.940 --> 13:18.560
the hope is not distant?

13:20.680 --> 13:21.790
What do you mean?

13:22.260 --> 13:24.210
Zhao Yuanzhou once mentioned to me

13:24.990 --> 13:26.990
that the clues about the Divine Wood

13:27.350 --> 13:28.610
are in Situ's Mansion.

13:30.030 --> 13:31.270
Situ's Mansion?

13:32.070 --> 13:32.950
Mr. Zhuo.

13:37.660 --> 13:38.580
Mr. Situ Ming.

13:38.620 --> 13:39.640
Mr. Zhuo,

13:39.960 --> 13:42.310
please take Ms. Wen Xiao away through the back door now.

13:42.310 --> 13:44.470
Mr. Situ, why are you so panicked?

13:44.670 --> 13:46.200
What on earth has happened?

14:02.220 --> 14:02.910
Zhen Mei,

14:02.930 --> 14:04.080
what are you doing?

14:07.270 --> 14:09.360
Wen Xiao from the Demon Hunting Bureau

14:09.360 --> 14:11.090
murdered the Prime Minister,

14:11.810 --> 14:13.400
resisted arrest, and fled,

14:13.540 --> 14:15.000
committing a grave crime.

14:16.110 --> 14:18.460
Chongwu Camp has been ordered to capture her.

14:18.460 --> 14:20.590
Those who block the way will be killed.

14:20.790 --> 14:22.110
The Prime Minister was murdered.

14:22.110 --> 14:23.870
Chongwu Camp is here to arrest the criminal.

14:23.870 --> 14:25.670
They claimed the murderer is...

14:27.750 --> 14:29.280
is Ms. Wen Xiao.

14:29.950 --> 14:31.270
Utterly absurd!

14:31.310 --> 14:33.170
How could it possibly be Wen Xiao?

14:33.290 --> 14:35.860
Many of the Prime Minister's attendants

14:36.920 --> 14:39.380
witnessed Wen Xiao publicly stop the horse.

14:44.360 --> 14:46.270
They said that after Wen Xiao got into the carriage,

14:46.270 --> 14:47.930
she brutally killed the Prime Minister.

14:47.930 --> 14:49.590
The blood dripped all the way.

14:51.030 --> 14:54.210
All the servants saw with their own eyes

14:54.560 --> 14:55.870
that inside the carriage,

14:55.060 --> 14:58.200
[Book of Rites]

14:56.170 --> 14:58.410
the Prime Minister's body was mutilated.

14:58.410 --> 15:00.160
Wen Xiao was covered in blood

15:00.720 --> 15:01.960
and ran away.

15:05.470 --> 15:06.600
Nonsense!

15:06.750 --> 15:08.350
Wen Xiao was in the Demon Hunting Bureau all night.

15:08.350 --> 15:10.280
All the guards can testify to that.

15:10.330 --> 15:12.160
I was here all night,

15:12.830 --> 15:15.430
being punished with house arrest by my father.

15:15.640 --> 15:16.760
Chongwu Camp

15:17.050 --> 15:18.740
is clearly framing me.

15:18.770 --> 15:19.650
In such a serious event

15:19.650 --> 15:20.780
as the Prime Minister's murder,

15:20.780 --> 15:22.840
they wouldn't casually frame anyone

15:23.090 --> 15:25.350
unless they were absolutely confident.

15:25.710 --> 15:26.590
There must be

15:26.920 --> 15:28.380
something fishy going on.

15:29.270 --> 15:30.910
The situation is unclear now,

15:30.910 --> 15:32.790
and there are a bunch of witnesses on both sides.

15:32.790 --> 15:34.520
We cannot prove our innocence.

15:34.550 --> 15:35.350
Mr. Zhuo,

15:35.580 --> 15:37.950
you should take Ms. Wen Xiao and leave now.

15:39.580 --> 15:41.470
Before Chongwu Camp closes the city gates,

15:41.470 --> 15:43.670
I'll take Wen Xiao and leave the city as soon as possible.

15:43.670 --> 15:44.390
No.

15:44.810 --> 15:46.210
I'm not leaving the city.

15:46.710 --> 15:48.370
They believe I will escape.

15:49.760 --> 15:51.790
So, at this moment, Tiandu City

15:52.050 --> 15:53.700
is the safest place.

15:54.420 --> 15:55.750
That's true.

15:55.910 --> 15:57.770
But Tiandu City is not that large.

15:57.830 --> 15:59.710
Chongwu Camp has ample forces in Tiandu City.

15:59.710 --> 16:01.720
They could search the entire city in two or three days.

16:01.720 --> 16:02.910
By the time they realize...

16:02.910 --> 16:03.470
So,

16:03.890 --> 16:05.720
Mr. Situ, please shelter me.

16:07.190 --> 16:07.880
What?

16:11.110 --> 16:12.300
Urgent matters need flexible solutions.

16:12.300 --> 16:13.300
It's not up to you.

16:14.790 --> 16:16.390
I'd like to see

16:17.060 --> 16:18.660
who dares to stop me.

16:19.040 --> 16:19.960
I do.

16:33.000 --> 16:40.550
[Arrest Warrant]

16:36.550 --> 16:38.500
King Xiang has issued an urgent decree

16:38.500 --> 16:42.430
to capture the true murderer, Wen Xiao, who killed the Prime Minister.

16:42.950 --> 16:45.210
Anyone who dares to obstruct will be regarded

16:45.210 --> 16:47.210
as having committed the same crime.

16:50.140 --> 16:51.310
Go in and arrest her.

17:26.990 --> 17:28.280
Commander,

17:28.430 --> 17:29.700
we have searched the entire Demon Hunting Bureau

17:29.700 --> 17:30.960
and haven't found her.

17:34.750 --> 17:36.480
Seal the city gate immediately

17:36.810 --> 17:38.470
and launch a citywide search.

17:39.030 --> 17:40.940
Inspect all inns and taverns,

17:41.950 --> 17:44.700
and issue a wanted notice

17:45.750 --> 17:47.750
for the serious criminal, Wen Xiao.

18:16.120 --> 18:17.040
Come out.

18:21.710 --> 18:22.350
Let's go.

18:22.350 --> 18:23.150
Go inside.

18:29.400 --> 18:31.920
Mr. Situ, I never expected your home to have such a rustic charm.

18:31.920 --> 18:32.850
Hurry inside.

18:32.880 --> 18:34.280
Don't let others see you.

18:39.920 --> 18:40.960
Come on.

18:57.100 --> 18:58.700
What's wrong with that room?

18:59.110 --> 19:00.550
Why is it sealed?

19:02.680 --> 19:03.350
Oh.

19:03.550 --> 19:05.390
That's my wife's bedroom.

19:05.510 --> 19:07.310
She has been bedridden for many years because of her illness

19:07.310 --> 19:08.510
and is sensitive to light and wind.

19:08.510 --> 19:10.240
It has been like this for years.

19:12.220 --> 19:13.040
Ms. Wen Xiao,

19:13.060 --> 19:13.580
come.

19:13.610 --> 19:14.330
Follow me.

19:14.950 --> 19:15.390
Okay.

19:38.540 --> 19:40.540
Jiu hasn't been home for a long time.

19:40.550 --> 19:42.610
How about you stay in his room for now?

20:18.110 --> 20:18.980
What a coincidence.

20:18.980 --> 20:20.030
You're here too?

20:21.330 --> 20:22.550
You're here too?

20:32.020 --> 20:33.170
I didn't expect

20:34.290 --> 20:35.380
it was Bai Jiu.

20:36.300 --> 20:37.110
Yeah,

20:38.440 --> 20:40.300
I didn't expect it was him either.

20:40.510 --> 20:42.200
I actually didn't expect you

20:42.280 --> 20:44.470
to be hunted down across the entire city.

20:44.470 --> 20:45.580
Impressive.

20:46.240 --> 20:48.100
What's so surprising about that?

20:48.370 --> 20:50.500
Since Mr. Situ is willing to take me in,

20:50.700 --> 20:54.390
I can take the chance to investigate the clues about the Divine Wood.

20:54.390 --> 20:56.370
It's you guys who are weird.

20:56.440 --> 20:58.550
Why are you here?

20:58.610 --> 21:00.590
To find the Divine Wood, of course.

21:09.600 --> 21:10.520
Commander Zhuo,

21:10.520 --> 21:12.530
this is the carriage the Prime Minister was in when he was murdered.

21:12.530 --> 21:13.730
It was just sent here.

21:23.300 --> 21:24.310
What's the smell?

21:25.030 --> 21:26.610
The attendants said that

21:26.640 --> 21:28.340
this criminal is highly skilled

21:28.340 --> 21:30.870
and killed the Prime Minister silently

21:30.890 --> 21:32.250
in one strike.

21:34.940 --> 21:36.280
Book of Rites?

21:36.480 --> 21:38.160
The Prime Minister should have memorized

21:38.160 --> 21:40.450
a classic book like this long ago.

21:40.680 --> 21:42.210
Why was he still reading it?

21:42.510 --> 21:44.180
The pages of this copy of the Book of Rites

21:44.180 --> 21:45.490
are yellowed.

21:46.470 --> 21:47.950
It must be quite old.

21:50.690 --> 21:51.940
The edges are worn,

21:52.800 --> 21:55.060
indicating it has been frequently read.

21:57.360 --> 21:59.020
However, the binding threads

21:59.360 --> 22:00.690
are new,

22:01.420 --> 22:03.420
suggesting it is highly cherished.

22:08.120 --> 22:10.860
Only by reading the works of sages can one be sensible

22:10.860 --> 22:11.550
and discern the true good and evil,

22:11.550 --> 22:13.950
right and wrong in the world.

22:16.700 --> 22:18.450
[Book of Rites]

22:16.790 --> 22:18.190
If one day

22:18.380 --> 22:20.310
I pass the imperial examinations,

22:20.320 --> 22:23.050
I will do something for the people of the world...

22:26.060 --> 22:26.850
Perhaps...

22:28.680 --> 22:31.940
the Prime Minister was just reminiscing about something.

22:33.600 --> 22:36.160
At present, rumors are swirling throughout the city,

22:36.160 --> 22:39.290
and tales of the demoness who eats humans are incessant.

22:39.390 --> 22:40.660
They all say the Prime Minister

22:40.660 --> 22:42.340
was eaten by a demoness,

22:42.370 --> 22:43.840
leaving only his skeleton.

22:43.840 --> 22:44.640
Mr. Fan,

22:45.530 --> 22:47.710
you raised Wen Xiao.

22:48.150 --> 22:49.480
Don't you know

22:50.720 --> 22:52.450
whether she is human or a demon?

22:52.470 --> 22:54.730
Of course I know it's not Wen Xiao.

22:54.990 --> 22:56.790
The demoness must be someone else.

22:56.790 --> 22:58.120
What's strange is that

22:58.510 --> 23:00.620
everyone present saw...

23:03.520 --> 23:05.780
it was Wen Xiao who stopped the carriage.

23:15.190 --> 23:17.190
Where is the Prime Minister's body?

23:22.120 --> 23:23.250
Sulfur?

23:28.080 --> 23:30.280
The people from Chongwu Camp have taken

23:30.430 --> 23:33.030
the Prime Minister's body away amid the chaos.

23:33.470 --> 23:35.520
Then these bones...

23:35.640 --> 23:37.530
This is another murder case

23:37.550 --> 23:40.080
that recently happened outside Tiandu City.

23:40.280 --> 23:42.980
A woodcutter was killed on his way home

23:45.040 --> 23:46.970
after chopping wood in the forest.

23:48.240 --> 23:49.710
His family believes he was killed by a demon,

23:49.710 --> 23:52.840
so they brought the remains to our Demon Hunting Bureau.

23:53.230 --> 23:55.290
The remains of the deceased are quite similar

23:55.290 --> 23:57.680
to those of the Prime Minister.

23:59.570 --> 24:00.850
I'm thinking

24:01.400 --> 24:02.520
that the bones

24:02.720 --> 24:03.980
have a smell of sulfur,

24:05.370 --> 24:07.360
and there was also

24:07.760 --> 24:10.090
a lingering sulfur smell in the carriage.

24:10.820 --> 24:11.890
Sulfur?

24:13.360 --> 24:15.920
What kind of demon has a sulfuric smell?

24:16.480 --> 24:17.540
It should be Ao Yin.

24:23.650 --> 24:24.500
Ying Lei?

24:24.740 --> 24:25.950
Why are you here?

24:25.970 --> 24:27.030
Mr. Zhuo.

24:27.460 --> 24:29.110
Did anything happen to Mount Kunlun?

24:29.110 --> 24:30.370
Kunlun is fine for now.

24:30.770 --> 24:32.240
Currently, the Mountain God, Mr. Lu Wu,

24:32.240 --> 24:33.670
along with several other mountain gods,

24:33.670 --> 24:34.950
is guarding the stone pillar.

24:34.950 --> 24:36.040
I came here

24:36.060 --> 24:37.470
because I successfully purified the Yao Water.

24:37.470 --> 24:38.280
Mr. Zhuo.

24:42.110 --> 24:43.090
Great.

24:44.160 --> 24:45.190
I was going to

24:45.320 --> 24:46.930
return it to the Goddess.

24:47.320 --> 24:49.390
However, as soon as I entered Tiandu City...

24:49.390 --> 24:50.620
It's truly audacious,

24:50.620 --> 24:51.990
even daring to kill the Prime Minister.

24:51.990 --> 24:53.150
It's said that it even eats people.

24:53.150 --> 24:54.470
It's a female demon, right?

24:54.470 --> 24:55.350
So there really are man-eating demons

24:55.350 --> 24:56.510
in the Demon Hunting Bureau.

24:56.510 --> 24:57.840
People are in panic now.

24:57.850 --> 24:59.180
The authorities have issued a wanted notice.

24:59.180 --> 25:00.810
Quickly catch her.

25:01.590 --> 25:03.380
A vicious female demon?

25:03.410 --> 25:05.540
Appeared in the Demon Hunting Bureau?

25:05.830 --> 25:06.390
It seems

25:06.390 --> 25:07.850
I need to help the Goddess.

25:11.100 --> 25:13.600
[Wanted Notice]

25:14.310 --> 25:15.270
Goddess...

25:16.410 --> 25:17.500
Goddess!

25:17.840 --> 25:19.010
I learned

25:19.070 --> 25:20.680
that the Goddess is wanted.

25:21.840 --> 25:23.840
It turns out she was framed by Ao Yin.

25:23.860 --> 25:25.050
What exactly

25:25.400 --> 25:26.950
is Ao Yin?

25:27.050 --> 25:27.790
Ao Yin

25:27.830 --> 25:30.250
is a bloodthirsty beast with claws like blades,

25:30.250 --> 25:32.060
residing in the volcanic area of the West Wilderness.

25:32.060 --> 25:33.150
It particularly likes

25:33.150 --> 25:33.830
eating human brains

25:33.830 --> 25:34.780
and hearts.

25:34.810 --> 25:35.700
It moves swiftly

25:35.700 --> 25:37.090
and is adept at hiding its tracks,

25:37.090 --> 25:38.860
preferring to travel alone under the cover of darkness.

25:38.860 --> 25:40.470
Volcanic areas

25:40.710 --> 25:42.410
happen to be rich in sulfur.

25:43.070 --> 25:43.960
Exactly.

25:44.240 --> 25:46.200
Is there any way to find her?

25:46.220 --> 25:46.990
Of course.

25:47.000 --> 25:47.730
My lord,

25:47.790 --> 25:48.820
we have discovered

25:48.820 --> 25:50.560
that Zhen Mei is gathering soldiers from Chongwu Camp

25:50.560 --> 25:52.220
and preparing to take action.

25:52.720 --> 25:54.450
I'll go and find Wen Xiao first.

25:55.250 --> 25:56.290
I'll leave the matter of Ao Yin

25:56.290 --> 25:57.460
to you.

25:57.550 --> 25:58.280
Don't worry.

25:59.920 --> 26:01.540
Well, I ran away,

26:01.670 --> 26:02.830
and you ran away too.

26:03.720 --> 26:05.580
Chongwu Camp must be furious now.

26:06.090 --> 26:09.440
Chongwu Camp has been busy capturing demons to conduct research.

26:09.440 --> 26:11.030
Creating a little chaos for them

26:11.030 --> 26:12.600
would distract them.

26:16.000 --> 26:18.800
Wen Zongyu has already affected your four senses.

26:19.020 --> 26:21.750
If your last sense is sealed with a silver needle,

26:21.910 --> 26:22.970
wouldn't you be...

26:23.030 --> 26:24.450
As a great demon, how could I

26:24.450 --> 26:26.580
be so easily stripped of my inner core?

26:26.810 --> 26:28.690
You'd better worry about

26:29.030 --> 26:32.960
how to clear your name from the charge of murdering the Prime Minister.

26:34.190 --> 26:35.690
I didn't expect that Wen Zongyu,

26:35.690 --> 26:37.040
who seems like a skilled doctor with a kind heart,

26:37.040 --> 26:38.570
could be so terrifying behind the scenes.

26:38.570 --> 26:40.300
He's been hiding his true face.

26:41.410 --> 26:43.340
There are many people who have been

26:43.670 --> 26:45.070
hiding their true faces.

26:53.390 --> 26:56.250
They should be bringing people to search here soon.

26:59.440 --> 27:00.290
Jiu.

27:00.430 --> 27:01.520
Jiu?

27:01.550 --> 27:02.840
Why are you back?

27:02.860 --> 27:04.280
I'm here to see my mother.

27:04.310 --> 27:05.110
Oh.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.480
Our friend is back.

27:14.390 --> 27:15.750
Didn't you say that once I return to Tiandu,

27:15.750 --> 27:17.070
I would see my mother?

27:17.350 --> 27:18.090
Yes.

27:18.660 --> 27:19.360
Jiu,

27:19.850 --> 27:21.060
have you eaten yet?

27:21.080 --> 27:22.390
Would you like something to eat?

27:22.390 --> 27:24.660
I'll go make you something you like.

27:24.700 --> 27:25.830
Mr. Situ,

27:25.860 --> 27:27.430
please prepare three more sets of chopsticks and bowls.

27:27.430 --> 27:29.170
There are three more people here.

27:29.170 --> 27:30.330
Zhao Yuanzhou?

27:30.630 --> 27:31.510
Ms. Pei?

27:31.540 --> 27:33.140
Why are you here?

27:33.300 --> 27:35.830
You escaped from the dungeon in Chongwu Camp?

27:46.260 --> 27:48.380
Why did you just run off?

27:49.390 --> 27:50.190
What?

27:50.650 --> 27:53.180
Are you going to Chongwu Camp to report again?

27:54.630 --> 27:55.530
Zhao Yuanzhou,

27:55.860 --> 27:57.920
what nonsense are you talking about?

27:59.950 --> 28:01.740
I think you all have misunderstood.

28:01.740 --> 28:03.960
I wrote that letter on purpose.

28:03.980 --> 28:05.630
I was afraid that our Jiu would be in danger,

28:05.630 --> 28:06.310
so I sent...

28:06.310 --> 28:07.970
It's not a misunderstanding.

28:08.950 --> 28:09.850
Bai Jiu

28:10.910 --> 28:12.930
is indeed a spy from Chongwu Camp.

28:13.330 --> 28:14.360
A spy?

28:24.070 --> 28:25.760
Why did you help Chongwu Camp?

28:31.690 --> 28:33.920
Do you remember what I said to you

28:34.030 --> 28:35.960
when the pagoda spirit tied you up?

28:39.990 --> 28:41.060
Jiu,

28:41.960 --> 28:43.410
Let me ask you seriously.

28:44.280 --> 28:45.420
Are you

28:47.300 --> 28:49.040
hiding something from us?

28:54.640 --> 28:55.680
I remember.

28:56.710 --> 28:59.110
Then let me ask you seriously one more time.

29:00.610 --> 29:02.770
Are you hiding something from us?

29:17.760 --> 29:19.900
So, would you rather be a traitor

29:23.030 --> 29:25.060
or be my friend?

29:30.530 --> 29:31.550
You choose.

29:34.220 --> 29:35.480
Mr. Zhuo,

29:36.310 --> 29:37.270
will you...

29:37.760 --> 29:39.850
still believe what I say?

29:41.280 --> 29:42.710
As long as you say it,

29:42.730 --> 29:43.860
I will believe you.

29:54.950 --> 29:56.830
Everything I did

30:00.190 --> 30:01.510
was for my mother.

30:05.770 --> 30:10.990
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

30:07.830 --> 30:09.440
Jiu,

30:10.200 --> 30:11.910
Mommy is coming to find you.

30:11.180 --> 30:16.440
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

30:14.110 --> 30:15.240
Ten.

30:16.550 --> 30:17.670
Nine.

30:17.790 --> 30:18.910
Eight.

30:18.040 --> 30:23.300
♫There're no worries in its eyes♫

30:18.930 --> 30:20.640
Seven.

30:20.810 --> 30:21.920
Six.

30:22.150 --> 30:23.280
Five.

30:23.470 --> 30:28.720
♫It just wants to sleep on a roof♫

30:23.510 --> 30:24.630
Four.

30:25.170 --> 30:26.280
Three.

30:26.830 --> 30:27.950
Two.

30:28.520 --> 30:29.630
One.

30:29.550 --> 30:32.550
♫The bell jingles and sways♫

30:32.730 --> 30:35.450
♫Thoughts circle back and forth♫

30:34.440 --> 30:36.220
I'm going to find you.

30:36.090 --> 30:41.270
♫Who can truly understand the essence of growing up?♫

30:39.070 --> 30:41.520
Where are you hiding?

30:41.950 --> 30:45.560
♫Life is grand♫

30:42.090 --> 30:44.190
I can't find you.

30:44.310 --> 30:45.820
Jiu?

30:45.850 --> 30:48.170
♫Yet so small♫

30:48.070 --> 30:50.460
Little Bai Jiu?

30:48.730 --> 30:53.200
♫I hope everything is fine♫

30:54.080 --> 30:57.180
♫The bell jingles and sways♫

30:57.270 --> 30:58.130
Mom.

30:57.300 --> 30:59.930
♫Thoughts circle back and forth♫

30:58.190 --> 31:00.000
No matter where you hide,

31:00.030 --> 31:02.350
no matter how long it takes

31:00.370 --> 31:05.560
♫Who can truly understand the essence of growing up?♫

31:02.870 --> 31:04.930
I will find you.

31:05.020 --> 31:05.670
Okay.

31:06.140 --> 31:09.870
♫Life is grand♫

31:10.330 --> 31:12.470
♫Yet so small♫

31:10.920 --> 31:13.450
Why did you throw away my cabinet?

31:13.010 --> 31:17.460
♫I hope everything is fine♫

31:13.870 --> 31:14.890
Jiu,

31:14.990 --> 31:16.070
that cabinet is old

31:16.070 --> 31:17.380
and broken.

31:17.520 --> 31:18.470
And you can hide

31:18.470 --> 31:19.990
somewhere else, can't you?

31:19.230 --> 31:24.480
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

31:19.990 --> 31:20.780
No!

31:20.950 --> 31:23.430
Then Mom won't be able to find me!

31:24.860 --> 31:29.620
♫The rain wet its feathers♫

31:30.230 --> 31:31.070
If you're going to throw it away,

31:31.070 --> 31:32.310
just throw me away with it.

31:31.310 --> 31:36.520
♫There're no worries in its eyes♫

31:36.710 --> 31:41.940
♫It just wants to sleep on a roof♫

32:06.990 --> 32:08.520
Mom!

32:08.540 --> 32:10.190
Mom!

32:10.350 --> 32:12.170
Mom!

32:12.350 --> 32:14.150
Mom!

32:14.430 --> 32:16.740
Mom!

32:16.920 --> 32:19.260
Mom!

32:19.880 --> 32:22.380
Mom!

32:22.480 --> 32:24.430
Mom!

32:24.470 --> 32:26.190
Mom!

32:26.210 --> 32:28.010
Mom!

32:29.000 --> 32:30.010
Mom!

32:30.110 --> 32:30.750
Jiu!

32:30.910 --> 32:32.050
-Jiu.
-Mom!

32:32.080 --> 32:32.550
Come here!

32:32.550 --> 32:33.430
Come here!

32:33.520 --> 32:34.860
-Don't go out.
-I want to save my mom!

32:34.860 --> 32:35.750
Don't go out!

32:36.450 --> 32:38.670
Your mom is fine.

32:50.450 --> 32:51.250
Jiu,

32:52.250 --> 32:53.900
you're dreaming.

32:54.320 --> 32:56.250
When you wake up tomorrow morning,

32:56.250 --> 32:57.470
it'll be fine.

33:09.490 --> 33:10.460
Mom!

33:11.720 --> 33:12.760
Mom,

33:12.790 --> 33:15.010
open the door, please.

33:16.400 --> 33:19.350
I'll be good and not play hide-and-seek anymore.

33:19.380 --> 33:21.550
I'll throw away the cabinet.

33:21.780 --> 33:24.640
open the door, please.

33:44.710 --> 33:48.200
Mom, today is my birthday.

33:48.890 --> 33:50.270
I've grown taller

33:50.350 --> 33:51.710
and tanned a bit.

33:52.150 --> 33:54.810
I've also learned a lot from many medical books.

33:55.230 --> 33:57.630
I will definitely cure you.

33:58.290 --> 33:59.860
Are you really

34:00.020 --> 34:02.170
not coming out to see me?

34:02.560 --> 34:05.170
Mom, I miss you so much.

34:05.400 --> 34:07.570
Every year on my birthday,

34:07.650 --> 34:10.270
my wish is to see you.

34:10.300 --> 34:12.560
Could you please open the door?

34:33.280 --> 34:34.199
Mom,

34:34.980 --> 34:37.449
I've finished reading all the medical books at home.

34:37.449 --> 34:40.159
I'm going out to find the best master to learn from.

34:40.159 --> 34:41.850
One day,

34:42.350 --> 34:43.989
I will definitely cure you.

35:39.780 --> 35:40.750
You are...

35:41.240 --> 35:43.410
I'm the new apprentice.

35:43.830 --> 35:44.870
My name is...

35:45.030 --> 35:45.670
Si...

35:47.440 --> 35:48.450
My name is Bai Jiu.

35:50.050 --> 35:50.900
Master,

35:50.930 --> 35:51.900
really?

35:51.920 --> 35:54.120
Can you really bring my mom back to life?

35:54.370 --> 35:55.940
I promise you

35:56.030 --> 35:57.890
I will bring your mom back to life.

35:58.360 --> 36:00.760
But I need your help with something as well.

36:00.970 --> 36:03.900
Join the vanguard squad of the Demon Hunting Bureau.

36:04.210 --> 36:07.100
I just need you to seal Zhu Yan's five senses.

36:14.390 --> 36:15.930
I know you have a kind heart.

36:15.960 --> 36:17.650
But Zhu Yan is a demon.

36:17.670 --> 36:19.870
Your mother was killed by a demon.

36:20.060 --> 36:22.340
If he isn't eliminated,

36:22.740 --> 36:24.010
there will be

36:24.070 --> 36:25.630
more children like you

36:25.630 --> 36:26.960
who lost their mothers.

36:31.470 --> 36:32.510
Jiu,

36:32.670 --> 36:34.230
you really are a fool.

36:34.310 --> 36:36.470
Your mother was not killed by a demon,

36:36.470 --> 36:37.710
nor is she sick.

36:39.920 --> 36:41.720
You were deceived by Wen Zongyu.

36:43.710 --> 36:44.880
Then my mom is...

36:54.410 --> 36:55.640
Mr. Situ,

36:56.530 --> 36:58.390
don't hide it from Jiu any longer.

38:09.850 --> 38:10.710
Where is my mom?

38:16.740 --> 38:17.780
Where is my mom?

38:25.780 --> 38:27.080
This is your mom.

38:31.320 --> 38:32.960
Nonsense.

38:34.190 --> 38:36.250
Your father is not talking nonsense.

38:36.950 --> 38:37.930
Your mother

38:40.240 --> 38:41.750
is not human.

38:44.660 --> 38:46.370
Your mother, like Ying Lei,

38:47.060 --> 38:48.980
is half god and half demon.

38:49.480 --> 38:51.320
She was born in ancient times.

38:52.250 --> 38:54.020
She's the same age as the gods.

38:58.280 --> 38:59.120
Yes.

38:59.310 --> 39:00.930
Your mother is the descendant of the White Emperor Shaohao

39:00.930 --> 39:02.950
and the Divine Tree of Jianmu.

39:06.180 --> 39:07.480
Her true form shares

39:07.500 --> 39:10.840
the same origin as the Divine Wood that transformed into the power of Baize,

39:10.840 --> 39:12.640
inheriting its spiritual vein.

39:12.900 --> 39:14.870
Therefore, during the Blood Moon eight years ago,

39:14.870 --> 39:16.380
the disappearance of the Baize Token

39:16.380 --> 39:17.790
severely injured her.

39:17.790 --> 39:18.270
Mom!

39:18.270 --> 39:20.430
She was forced to manifest her true form.

39:20.430 --> 39:22.510
Mom!

39:22.950 --> 39:25.030
Mom!

39:45.550 --> 39:47.520
Even if my mom turned into a tree

39:47.630 --> 39:49.290
and returned to her true form,

39:49.320 --> 39:51.640
why has she never talked to me

39:52.940 --> 39:54.470
or been willing to respond?

39:56.680 --> 39:58.410
With the loss of the Baize Token

39:59.840 --> 40:02.170
and the Goddess absent from her position,

40:02.530 --> 40:04.860
the Wilderness has fallen into disarray.

40:05.700 --> 40:08.290
Therefore, Lord Bai Yan lost her soul

40:08.890 --> 40:10.710
and had no choice but to stay in her true form

40:10.710 --> 40:12.390
in the world.

40:15.800 --> 40:16.670
Mom,

40:18.160 --> 40:19.360
can you hear me?

40:21.810 --> 40:22.420
I...

40:23.750 --> 40:25.260
I'm Jiu.

40:27.240 --> 40:28.380
I'm back.

40:35.960 --> 40:36.970
I'm back.

40:54.920 --> 40:57.400
Can my mom return to her original form?

40:58.480 --> 41:00.540
As long as the Baize Token is repaired

41:01.040 --> 41:02.840
and the Wilderness is restored,

41:03.960 --> 41:05.630
your mother will come back.

41:09.470 --> 41:11.310
Why did no one tell me?

41:12.430 --> 41:14.680
You were too young at that time.

41:15.110 --> 41:15.950
I didn't know

41:15.950 --> 41:17.080
how you would accept

41:17.370 --> 41:19.480
all of this after I told you.

41:21.070 --> 41:23.870
For an ordinary person, it's indeed hard to accept

41:24.110 --> 41:26.710
without going through all this.

41:27.350 --> 41:29.680
But Bai Jiu has the right to know the truth.

41:31.770 --> 41:33.180
Although he is young,

41:33.600 --> 41:36.060
he is much more mature than children his age.

41:36.760 --> 41:37.940
I believe

41:38.910 --> 41:40.350
that if you had told him

41:40.370 --> 41:41.650
the truth back then,

41:42.280 --> 41:43.840
Jiu would have understood.

41:45.020 --> 41:46.130
If you

41:46.230 --> 41:48.020
had told me the truth earlier,

41:49.290 --> 41:51.950
perhaps I wouldn't have been used by Wen Zongyu.

41:52.740 --> 41:54.240
I'm sorry.

41:54.260 --> 41:55.020
No.

41:55.870 --> 41:57.030
It was my fault.

41:59.480 --> 42:00.460
I'm sorry.

42:02.670 --> 42:03.840
I was wrong.

42:06.500 --> 42:07.590
I'm sorry.

42:09.120 --> 42:10.640
I hurt you guys.

42:12.280 --> 42:13.410
All of you

42:13.630 --> 42:14.960
have been sincere to me,

42:17.250 --> 42:19.130
but I have let down your trust.

42:20.490 --> 42:21.660
Jiu.

42:42.020 --> 42:43.120
Jiu,

42:43.880 --> 42:45.190
you've grown up.

42:45.960 --> 42:47.510
The bond between father and son,

42:47.510 --> 42:49.170
the loyalty between friends,

42:49.570 --> 42:51.630
rights and wrongs, gains and losses—

42:53.310 --> 42:55.340
you can understand them on your own.

42:58.930 --> 43:00.460
It's okay to make mistakes.

43:02.520 --> 43:03.610
As long as

43:03.640 --> 43:05.800
you can bear the cost of growing up

43:07.120 --> 43:08.380
and try to make amends.

43:14.040 --> 43:15.840
The sea of suffering is endless.

43:16.660 --> 43:18.920
As long as you return to the shore in time,

43:19.320 --> 43:22.380
there will still be a brilliant sunset waiting for you.

43:30.760 --> 43:31.550
In fact,

43:32.110 --> 43:33.710
the real culprit

43:34.670 --> 43:35.950
is not you, this easily fooled

43:35.950 --> 43:37.270
little bunny.

43:37.660 --> 43:40.270
But the truly cunning and deceitful wolf.

43:43.430 --> 43:44.430
Stop hiding.

43:44.660 --> 43:45.990
Come out.
